title: "GOEF: Globality-Orientated Evaluation Framework for Few-shot Image Anomaly Detection"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Globality-Orientated Evaluation Framework
  (GOEF), which replaces the single-reference evaluation of few-shot image
  anomaly detection with a globality-preserving estimate.
